      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The results of longlasting experience in the treatment of severe chronic pain are reported. 82% of 103 in-patients with chronic pain responded to a combined treatment with neuroleptic and antidepressant drugs. A dosing strategy for the combbination of clomipramine and haloperidol is described."},
